<title>CHINA: China 1996 oilseeds area down 4.2 pct at August.</title>
<headline>China 1996 oilseeds area down 4.2 pct at August.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-11-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The area of cultivated land under oil-bearing crops fell by 4.2 percent in 1996 according to State Statistical Bureau figures available at the end of August, the Financial News said on Saturday.</p>
<p>It said the area had fallen by 550,000 hectares.</p>
</text>
